WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t3-07-career-transition.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.820
You are caught between two distinct paths

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:10.020
Watching your mind continuously rehearse both scenarios without landing on
either.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.080
Or perhaps the choice is already made.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:29.090
But your nervous system is still bracing as if the threat is actively present.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.800
No one outside your skin can hand you the right verdict.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:50.280
What we can do right now is shift the internal state you are deciding from.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:51.710
The body leads

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.750
The observing mind follows.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.870
Most of our exhaustion lives in the gap where those two fight.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.500
4. Clear phases.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:05.810
Let's move through them together. We begin by mapping where this crossroad is
currently held in your body.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.710
Notice the somatic markers of unresolved trajectory.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:22.130
A persistent weight

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.110
Resting behind your sternum

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.680
A knot of muscle guarding the upper abd

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:33.030
Or that quiet hum of high pivigilance that steals your restful sleep before
the work week even starts.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:36.410
Give this sensation a single descriptive word.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.470
Unsteady

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.450
Observe what that word honors.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:09.550
It names your current nervous system activation, not your worth or competence.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.920
When a professional environment no longer mirrors your internal growth,

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:20.560
The survival brain misinterprets the crossroad as an existential threat to
your safety and identity.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:39.700
Look beneath the paralysis to identify the true hidden driver.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.510
A protective attempt to shield you from loss of control

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.240
Professional obsolescence

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:01.320
Or financial vulnerability.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.700
Sinking to that core apprehension for just a moment.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:23.100
It doesn't need fixing right now, it simply needs to be acknowledged.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.060
Now we adjust your nervous system to restore internal safety.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.880
Draw a slow, deep breath in for 6 counts.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:01.620
And release it smoothly for 6 counts

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:02.720
Balanced

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:07.300
Easy, unforced, direct your awareness toward the center of your chest.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:11.870
Feel the solid contact of your feet grounding into the floor beneath you.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:28.280
Whatever is pending in your calendar, you are completely anchored in this
precise room right now.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:32.570
Thoughts, scenarios and warnings will inevitably surface.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.210
That is simply the mind doing its job.

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:42.040
Let them drift in like passing weather. Don't grab them, don't argue with
them, and don't try to solve them.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:48.220
An arising thought is just neural activity.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.670
It is not an order to take action.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:55.450
If you feel yourself straining to meditate correctly, soften your effort.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.190
Striving means the defense mechanism has taken over again.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.980
Rest here in this calm breath cycle.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.900
Letting your heart rate settle.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:16.390
We untangle the actual facts from the mental simulations exhausting your
system.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.750
There are two entirely different dynamics occurring here.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:33.360
First, there is the objective situation. Real parameters like finances,
contractual agreements,

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.770
And market timing.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.930
Second, there is the endless cognitive loop.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:44.260
Rehearsing what happens if you leave, what breaks if you stay, or where you'll
be three years from now.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.310
None of those loops offer resolution.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:55.190
Because you cannot solve a future equation with present speculation.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.870
The situation remains.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:05.220
But you can choose to lay down the heavy burden of constant forecasting.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:16.600
Pause to extend genuine compassion toward the vigilant part of your psyche
that has been running these simulations.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:20.980
That background engine was only trying to guarantee your security

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:21.890
Status

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.210
And survival.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:26.640
Think that internal guardian for its tireless protection?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:32.860
And gently communicate that it can power down for the remainder of this
session. Ask yourself gently.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.900
What original purpose was this chronic checking serving?

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:47.330
Something deep within you learned that high-stakes transitions carry severe
costs.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:52.630
Activating an ancient vigilance to keep you safe from shame or isolation.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:59.400
Put those underlying attachment and survival fears where your breath is and
let them go out with it.

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:06.760
You don't need to resolve them in this minute.

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:10.380
Some answers only arrive after movement begins.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:11.660
Finally

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.190
We step into clear

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.030
Self-directed agency

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.510
Imagine observing yourself from across the room

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:24.880
Sitting with this open question

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.820
Shoulders slightly tense, holding the weight of the unknown.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.250
That is merely a temporary state.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.420
Not your permanent identity.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:50.780
Visualize the version of yourself you want to embody as you navigate this
crossroad.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.740
The uncertainty hasn't magically vanished.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.260
But your relationship to it has changed.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.370
You are no longer consumed by panic.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:05.360
You are in command of where your focus goes.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:16.310
Instead of obsessing over hypothetical outcomes, ground your focus in
immediate discovery. Ask yourself:

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:23.920
What is one small concrete piece of information I don't currently possess?

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:29.500
A single-candid conversation an updated budget figure or a direct inquiry

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:31.420
Pick that one micro step.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:35.150
When you are ready, take one final deep breath in for six,

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.480
An out for six

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.080
Feel the solid ground supporting your feet.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:44.760
Roll your shoulders slowly, letting the tension in your neck loosen. Stretch
your arms out.

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.130
And open your eyes.

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:52.030
You can return to this anchor whenever the noise of the transition begins to
overwhelm your clarity.
